    "description": "<p>The user maintains a Devourer Clock of 6 spans.</p><p>When the user is attacked with a @Trait[dark]-type attack, they take no damage (though secondary effects still apply) and the user increments their Devourer Clock. This clock persists between encounters.</p><p>When the Devourer Clock is full, the user may use the move Evil-Quelling Effluence.</p><p>If the user has the @UUID[Compendium.ptr2e.core-abilities.wJ3FzgNXzpgsOud5]{Guard Dog} ability active, this ability grants +1 Special Attack for 5 activations whenever the user would be hit by an action with the @Trait[social] trait.</p>",
